# Generated on first embedded `monitor()` boot as `.env.autopulse` (gitignored).
# Synthetic stack / local builds: `set -a && source .env.autopulse && set +a` before `npm run build`.
#
# When the dashboard static UI is served from the same FastAPI app (embedded), keep a path-only base
# so the browser does not call another host/port (avoids CORS): use /autopulse, not http://localhost:8010/autopulse.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTOPULSE_API_BASE_URL=/autopulse
# AUTOPULSE_EMBEDDED_API_KEY=ap_live_…
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTOPULSE_API_KEY=ap_live_…
